    <article class=3D"markdown-body"><h1 id=3D"getting-started">Getting Sta=
rted</h1>
<ul class=3D"list">
<li><a href=3D"https://sdk.onbase.com/rest/OnBase/Foundation26.1/document/p=
rogrammers-guide/api-getting-started.html#getting-started">Getting Started<=
/a><ul class=3D"list">
<li><a href=3D"https://sdk.onbase.com/rest/OnBase/Foundation26.1/document/p=
rogrammers-guide/api-getting-started.html#introduction">Introduction</a></l=
i>
<li><a href=3D"https://sdk.onbase.com/rest/OnBase/Foundation26.1/document/p=
rogrammers-guide/api-getting-started.html#api-server">API Server</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://sdk.onbase.com/rest/OnBase/Foundation26.1/document/p=
rogrammers-guide/api-getting-started.html#identity-provider">Identity Provi=
der</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://sdk.onbase.com/rest/OnBase/Foundation26.1/document/p=
rogrammers-guide/api-getting-started.html#temp-file-storage">Temp File Stor=
age</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://sdk.onbase.com/rest/OnBase/Foundation26.1/document/p=
rogrammers-guide/api-getting-started.html#database">Database</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://sdk.onbase.com/rest/OnBase/Foundation26.1/document/p=
